From: Studio (C1, claude/r4-content)
Subject: [PATCH 017] harness: each part as pagesBoard takes it (the card's own page), and the beat of the page up (director14 S9, S9b)

S9 (director14 c5-t01 steady 18, stuck 18, offtopic 26, steering 14). Production pages a picture turn correctly. Studio's
seam on the run's own shape draws c5-t01 stuck 18 as fraction-bars (the example) then fraction-line den 8 from "Isi".
evals/hybrid-side-by-side.mjs checks the parts one by one, and each part kept the turn's picture `request` and no
ofCard. So every part was preselected as a second view, and the record said bars on both pages. This patch takes each
part as pagesBoard does: the request on the first page only, its own ofCard, and cardPage on a LATER part whose ofCard is
true (pagesBoard's mark: Studio's preselect gives that page the card's own board, never a second view). Not on the first
part: Brain marks the card's board ofCard true before her line exists, and that page of a picture turn is the view.
S9b (c6 stuck 18). Studio gives a remediation's board up its own second view. For that, the harness keeps shownKind
beside shownRef, as seam.js keeps wbPrevKind: the take's lastKind or its scriptBeat.kind, and a paged turn's lastKind.
It passes avoidKind to the preselect.
Checked on the run's c5-t01 stuck 18 card part (den 8 line, key 8): old → fraction-bars@1; with 017 → fraction-line@1.

